{"id":"lesson-src-a52f413316e314","moduleNumber":505,"headword":"application","title":"Application","subtitle":"申請、申請表、書面提交、應用程式——哪些詞真的接近 application？","description":"申請、申請表、書面提交、應用程式——哪些詞真的接近 application？","words":[{"order":1,"word":"Application form","meaning":"申請表","note":"和 application 在「需要填寫並提交的申請文件」語境中非常接近。比 application 更明確指出是表格本身。","example":"這裡的 application 是否明確指需要填寫的表格？","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Please complete the application before submitting your supporting documents.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"application form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"application form","explanation":"明確指需要填寫的申請表。"},{"letter":"B","text":"submission","explanation":"指已提交材料。"},{"letter":"C","text":"written submission","explanation":"更像長篇書面材料。"},{"letter":"D","text":"request","explanation":"只是請求。"},{"letter":"E","text":"proposal","explanation":"是提案。"},{"letter":"F","text":"registration","explanation":"是登記。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The scholarship application asks for two references.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"application form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"application form","explanation":"「表格要求填寫哪些資料」最自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"submission","explanation":"不突出表格欄位。"},{"letter":"C","text":"request form","explanation":"除非是一般請求型表格。"},{"letter":"D","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"registration","explanation":"不同流程。"},{"letter":"F","text":"proposal","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"You must sign the application before sending it to the admissions office.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"application form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"application form","explanation":"需簽署並寄出的表格。"},{"letter":"B","text":"written submission","explanation":"未必固定表格。"},{"letter":"C","text":"submission","explanation":"偏提交後的材料。"},{"letter":"D","text":"request","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":2,"word":"Form","meaning":"表格；申請表","note":"當上下文已清楚知道是在申請甚麼時，form 可以自然地代替 application form。","example":"上下文是否已經清楚，讓單獨的 form 不會產生歧義？","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Have you finished the application for the summer course?","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"form","explanation":"上下文已清楚是課程申請。"},{"letter":"B","text":"submission","explanation":"偏已提交文件。"},{"letter":"C","text":"request","explanation":"不夠正式。"},{"letter":"D","text":"proposal","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"registration","explanation":"可能是後續步驟。"},{"letter":"F","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The visa application is available online.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"form","explanation":"在語境明確時自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"software application","explanation":"tech sense。"},{"letter":"C","text":"request","explanation":"不是表格本身。"},{"letter":"D","text":"submission","explanation":"偏提交物。"},{"letter":"E","text":"registration","explanation":"不同。"},{"letter":"F","text":"proposal","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"I forgot to attach a photograph to the application.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"form","explanation":"明確指附照片的申請表。"},{"letter":"B","text":"submission","explanation":"也可能，但較廣。"},{"letter":"C","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"request","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"software tool","explanation":"tech sense。"},{"letter":"F","text":"platform","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":3,"word":"Request form","meaning":"申請表；請求表格","note":"表示用來正式提出某項要求的表格。比一般 application form 更適合設備、假期、退款、服務、許可等請求型申請。","example":"","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Employees must complete an application to request annual leave.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"request form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"request form","explanation":"假期請求表最自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"application form","explanation":"也可能，但較一般。"},{"letter":"C","text":"written submission","explanation":"太正式／太廣。"},{"letter":"D","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"proposal","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Submit the application if you need a replacement access card.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"request form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"request form","explanation":"申請替換卡是 request 型流程。"},{"letter":"B","text":"application form","explanation":"也可，但較不精確。"},{"letter":"C","text":"submission","explanation":"只是材料總稱。"},{"letter":"D","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"proposal","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"software application","explanation":"tech sense。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The IT department has an application for requesting new equipment.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"request form","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"request form","explanation":"設備申請／請求型表格。"},{"letter":"B","text":"application form","explanation":"也接近。"},{"letter":"C","text":"written submission","explanation":"不必要地正式。"},{"letter":"D","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"software tool","explanation":"如果是系統本身才可能。"},{"letter":"F","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":4,"word":"Written submission","meaning":"書面提交；書面申請","note":"表示以書面形式正式提交的申請、陳述或材料。比 application 更強調書面內容與正式提交，而不一定是一張固定格式表格。","example":"","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The fellowship application must explain your research interests in detail.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"written submission","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"written submission","explanation":"需要較完整的書面內容。"},{"letter":"B","text":"form","explanation":"太簡化。"},{"letter":"C","text":"request form","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"app","explanation":"tech sense。"},{"letter":"F","text":"program","explanation":"tech sense。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Candidates must send an application describing their relevant experience.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"written submission","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"written submission","explanation":"強調書面陳述內容。"},{"letter":"B","text":"application form","explanation":"若只是填表則太窄。"},{"letter":"C","text":"form","explanation":"太一般。"},{"letter":"D","text":"request","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"proposal","explanation":"除非內容是計劃提案。"},{"letter":"F","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The award application includes a 1,000-word statement.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"written submission","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"written submission","explanation":"1,000 字書面材料最吻合。"},{"letter":"B","text":"form","explanation":"太窄。"},{"letter":"C","text":"request form","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"submission","explanation":"也可但少了書面特徵。"},{"letter":"E","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"software application","explanation":"tech sense。"}]}]},{"order":5,"word":"Submission","meaning":"提交材料；申請文件","note":"表示已提交的文件、資料或申請。和 application 很接近，但 submission 更突出交出去的那份材料或「提交」這個結果。","example":"","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Late applications will not be accepted.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"submissions","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"submissions","explanation":"已交出的申請材料。"},{"letter":"B","text":"forms","explanation":"可能只是其中一部分。"},{"letter":"C","text":"requests","explanation":"太廣。"},{"letter":"D","text":"registrations","explanation":"不同。"},{"letter":"E","text":"proposals","explanation":"不合一般申請。"},{"letter":"F","text":"programs","explanation":"tech sense。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Each application will be reviewed by two assessors.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"submission","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"submission","explanation":"被評審的提交材料。"},{"letter":"B","text":"form","explanation":"可能只指表格。"},{"letter":"C","text":"request form","explanation":"太窄。"},{"letter":"D","text":"registration","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"petition","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"software tool","explanation":"tech sense。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The committee received more than 500 applications this year.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"submissions","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"submissions","explanation":"強調收到的申請材料。"},{"letter":"B","text":"forms","explanation":"可能但較窄。"},{"letter":"C","text":"requests","explanation":"不一定正式申請。"},{"letter":"D","text":"registrations","explanation":"不同。"},{"letter":"E","text":"proposals","explanation":"不一定。"},{"letter":"F","text":"apps","explanation":"tech sense。"}]}]},{"order":6,"word":"App","meaning":"應用程式；App","note":"最常見、最口語的替代。尤其常用於手機、平板、網頁服務和消費者軟件。","example":"這是否是一般使用者會稱為 app 的軟件？","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Download the application from the App Store.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"app","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"app","explanation":"最自然的 consumer software 用法。"},{"letter":"B","text":"program","explanation":"也可能，但 mobile app 更自然。"},{"letter":"C","text":"software tool","explanation":"更偏功能描述。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"範圍更大。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不一定是 app。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The application sends notifications when your order is ready.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"app","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"app","explanation":"手機服務語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"software application","explanation":"也可但較正式。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"較一般。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"可能包含多個功能／服務。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"太大。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不一定能推播。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Users can open the application on their phones to scan the QR code.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"app","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"app","explanation":"手機操作最自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"program","explanation":"可以但不如 app。"},{"letter":"C","text":"software tool","explanation":"偏任務工具。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"不精確。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不一定是安裝程式。"}]}]},{"order":7,"word":"Software application","meaning":"軟件應用程式","note":"和 tech sense 的 application 幾乎完全相同，但表達更完整、正式，也可避免和「申請」義混淆。","example":"是否需要正式、清楚地表明這個 application 是軟件？","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The company developed an application for inventory management.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"software application","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"software application","explanation":"正式、清楚。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可，但可能太口語。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"接近。"},{"letter":"D","text":"software tool","explanation":"也接近，但強調工具用途。"},{"letter":"E","text":"platform","explanation":"範圍更大。"},{"letter":"F","text":"system","explanation":"可能包含多個組件。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"This application runs on both Windows and macOS.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"software application","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"software application","explanation":"桌面軟件語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可但稍口語。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"也接近。"},{"letter":"D","text":"website","explanation":"不合本地 OS 運行語境。"},{"letter":"E","text":"platform","explanation":"不同。"},{"letter":"F","text":"system","explanation":"太廣。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The hospital uses a secure application to manage patient records.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"software application","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"software application","explanation":"正式企業／醫療軟件語境。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"可能太口語。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"也可。"},{"letter":"D","text":"software tool","explanation":"也接近，但不如 application 完整。"},{"letter":"E","text":"platform","explanation":"不一定。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不精確。"}]}]},{"order":8,"word":"Program","meaning":"程式；軟件程式","note":"在很多一般電腦語境中，program 可以和 application 接近，尤其指可以執行特定工作的軟件。","example":"","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The application lets users edit video files.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"program","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"program","explanation":"一般電腦軟件語境。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可。"},{"letter":"C","text":"software application","explanation":"更正式。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"website","explanation":"不一定。"},{"letter":"F","text":"system","explanation":"太廣。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"You need to install the application before opening the file.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"program","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"program","explanation":"需安裝的電腦軟件。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可能。"},{"letter":"C","text":"software tool","explanation":"也可但偏功能描述。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"不精確。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不需安裝。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The application automatically converts the document to PDF.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"program","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"program","explanation":"執行特定電腦功能。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可。"},{"letter":"C","text":"software application","explanation":"也可且較正式。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"太廣。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"不精確。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"未必。"}]}]},{"order":9,"word":"Software tool","meaning":"軟件工具；數碼工具","note":"表示用來完成特定工作或任務的軟件。和 application 接近，但比 app/program 更突出工具用途。","example":"這個 application 是否主要被視為完成某項工作的工具？","exampleZh":"","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The application helps researchers analyse large datasets.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"software tool","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"software tool","explanation":"明確是分析工作的工具。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可但較一般。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"也接近。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"可能太廣。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"太大。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不一定。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"We use an application to track deadlines and assign tasks.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"software tool","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"software tool","explanation":"生產力工具用途明確。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也自然。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"也可以。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"如果有協作生態才更接近。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"太廣。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不精確。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"This application can check documents for formatting errors.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"software tool","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"software tool","explanation":"完成具體任務的工具。"},{"letter":"B","text":"app","explanation":"也可。"},{"letter":"C","text":"program","explanation":"也可。"},{"letter":"D","text":"platform","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"system","explanation":"太廣。"},{"letter":"F","text":"website","explanation":"不一定。"}]}]}],"falseSynonyms":[{"word":"Request","zh":"請求不等於申請文件 request 是提出要求本身；application 通常更正式，而且往往有固定程序或文件。","point":"She made a request for more information. She submitted an application for the scholarship."},{"word":"Petition","zh":"請願不等於一般申請 petition 通常是正式請願，常涉及公共、法律或集體訴求。","point":""},{"word":"Proposal","zh":"提案不等於申請 proposal 是提出計劃、想法或方案；不是一般 job/visa/university application 的同義詞。","point":""},{"word":"Registration","zh":"登記不等於申請 registration 通常是正式登記加入、記錄或註冊；某些流程可能先申請再登記。","point":""},{"word":"Software","zh":"軟件不等於單一應用程式 software 是更廣泛的總稱，可包括 operating systems、drivers、applications 等。","point":""},{"word":"Platform","zh":"平台不等於 app platform 通常是提供服務、生態系統或運行環境的系統，範圍比單一 application 大。","point":""},{"word":"System","zh":"系統不等於應用程式 system 可以包含多個 applications、database、hardware 和流程。","point":""},{"word":"Website","zh":"網站不一定是應用程式 有些 web apps 也是網站，但一般資訊網站不等於 application。","point":""}],"sourceFile":"/synonyms/source/application_close_synonyms_material.md","priorityRank":505,"omittedExercises":0}